+
+// [#protodoc-title: gRPC-JSON transcoder]
+// gRPC-JSON transcoder :ref:`configuration overview <config_http_filters_grpc_json_transcoder>`.
+// [#extension: envoy.filters.http.grpc_json_transcoder]
