+// The Scoped Routes Discovery Service (SRDS) API distributes
+// :ref:`ScopedRouteConfiguration<envoy_v3_api_msg.ScopedRouteConfiguration>`
+// resources. Each ScopedRouteConfiguration resource represents a "routing
